  "protocol": "RedKeysCoin",
  "name": "RedKeysGame playGame draws its outcome from block data a caller contract can compute",
  "summary": "RedKeysGame.playGame() settles each bet in the same call with randomNumber(), a hash of counter, block.timestamp, block.prevrandao, block.coinbase, block.gaslimit, block.number and msg.sender, all of which a calling contract can compute first. The attacker's contract replicated the draw and placed only winning 100,000-REDKEYS bets at 2:1 odds paying 3x, 4,833 of them over 27 transactions, draining 1,905M REDKEYS from the game's bankroll, which it sold for 21.1 BNB.",
